sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Employee / IT Admin
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant Cognito as Cognito (Auth)
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant Lambda as Lambda
    participant Sup as Supervisor Agent
    participant ITAg as IT Agent
    participant HRAg as HR Agent
    participant ITTools as IT Tools
    participant ITKB as IT KB
    participant MCP as MCP (Ticket System)
    participant HRTools as HR Tools
    participant HRKB as HR KB
    participant S3 as Knowledge Base (S3)
    participant DDB as DynamoDB
    participant CW as CloudWatch

    %% ===== AUTH =====
    User->>FE: Open app / login
    FE->>Cognito: Authenticate user
    Cognito-->>FE: Auth token (session)

    %% ===== REQUEST =====
    User->>FE: Ask question / raise ticket
    FE->>APIGW: HTTPS request (with token)
    APIGW->>Lambda: Forward request
    Lambda->>Sup: Invoke Supervisor Agent

    %% ===== ROUTING =====
    alt IT-related request
        Sup->>ITAg: Route to IT Agent
        ITAg->>ITTools: Call IT tool(s)
        ITTools-->>ITAg: Tool result
        ITAg->>ITKB: Query knowledge base
        ITKB->>S3: Retrieve IT/company docs
        S3-->>ITKB: Relevant docs
        ITKB-->>ITAg: KB context
        ITAg->>MCP: Create/update ticket
        MCP->>DDB: Write to Tickets table
        DDB-->>MCP: Ack
        MCP-->>ITAg: Ticket confirmation
        ITAg-->>Sup: IT Agent response
    else HR-related request
        Sup->>HRAg: Route to HR Agent
        HRAg->>HRTools: Call HR tool(s)
        HRTools-->>HRAg: Tool result
        HRAg->>HRKB: Query knowledge base
        HRKB->>S3: Retrieve HR policy docs
        S3-->>HRKB: Relevant docs
        HRKB-->>HRAg: KB context
        HRAg->>DDB: Read/write Leave / Approvals
        DDB-->>HRAg: Data result
        HRAg-->>Sup: HR Agent response
    end

    %% ===== MEMORY / CONVERSATION LOG =====
    Sup->>DDB: Write Conversations / Employees context
    DDB-->>Sup: Ack

    %% ===== RESPONSE =====
    Sup-->>Lambda: Aggregated agent response
    Lambda-->>APIGW: Response payload
    APIGW-->>FE: Response
    FE-->>User: Display answer / ticket status

    %% ===== OBSERVABILITY (async) =====
    par Telemetry
        Sup->>CW: Send logs, metrics, traces
        ITAg->>CW: Send logs, metrics, traces
        HRAg->>CW: Send logs, metrics, traces
    end